    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\">The [[lookup @name lowercase]] conjures a charming or frightening song.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Wisdom Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=ovXNUYiRFsNC9lFh]], each [[lookup @target.affects.type activity=ovXNUYiRFsNC9lFh]] in a [[lookup @target.template.size activity=ovXNUYiRFsNC9lFh]]-foot Emanation originating from the [[lookup @name lowercase]].</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Failure:</em> The target is subjected to the song’s effect:</p><p><strong>Charming</strong>. The target has the &amp;Reference[Charmed apply=false] condition for [[lookup @duration.value activity=mOFKBLSi65tp5u3i]] [[lookup @duration.units activity=mOFKBLSi65tp5u3i]]. While Charmed, the target has the &amp;Reference[Incapacitated apply=false] condition and uses all its movement to dance in place. The effect ends on the target if it takes any damage.</p><p><strong>Frightening</strong>. [[/damage average]] damage, and the target has the &amp;Reference[Frightened apply=false] condition for [[lookup @duration.value activity=ib78HezKRQ8jxfKz]] [[lookup @duration.units activity=ib78HezKRQ8jxfKz]]. If the target ends its turn out of line of sight from the [[lookup @name lowercase]], the condition ends on it.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
